Grove original art
==================

All files under apps/web/public/art/ are original work created for Grove
(code name Aetheria), including 16-bit dusk-lantern floor tiles and
character sprites under tiles/ and chars/. Geometric CSS avatars remain
original. They are not derived from Metro City, LimeZu, Star Office World,
Pixel Agents, or any third-party sprite pack.

See manifest.json for sprite/tile mapping. Side sprites face viewer's right;
flip in-engine for left.

License: Apache-2.0, same as the Grove repository, unless a file says otherwise.

Do not add third-party commercial-restricted sprite packs to this directory.
